;; true single-module iteration use REPL/modules/<MODULE>.repl instead.
;;
;; Build status: P2 in progress — suites are folded in + contamination-resolved incrementally.
;;   Markers:  ;;P2>  = folded in and green   ·  ;;P2-TODO> = pending fold-in (contamination/slow)
;;
